## IP Address Lookup ##

In most cases, an IP lookup website will be used to determine the public IP address of the network and not the private IP address of the computer. The ISP and approximate city or region may be displayed for Home Wi-Fi, or a carrier gateway location may be displayed for mobile data. Normally, it is not able to determine the exact address of a user.
















